### Create trade form as User 1
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tradeforms
Authorization: Bearer {{user1_token}}
Idempotency-Key: create-{{uid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "USDT OTC",
  "description": "P2P swap",
  "amount": "1000.00"
}

### Fetch trade form as counterparty before VC verification (minimal payload)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tradeforms/{{trade_uid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user2_token}}

### Verify VC as User 2
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tradeforms/{{trade_uid}}/verify-vc
Authorization: Bearer {{user2_token}}
Idempotency-Key: verify-{{uid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credential": {
    "kycApproved": true
  }
}

### Confirm as User 2
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tradeforms/{{trade_uid}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{user2_token}}
Idempotency-Key: confirm-user2-{{uid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "user2"
}

### Confirm as User 1
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tradeforms/{{trade_uid}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{user1_token}}
Idempotency-Key: confirm-user1-{{uid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "user1"
}

### Platform finalizes trade
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tradeforms/{{trade_uid}}/finalize
Authorization: Bearer {{platform_token}}
Idempotency-Key: finalize-{{uid}}

### Fetch audit log as participant
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tradeforms/{{trade_uid}}/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{user1_token}}

### List my trade forms
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/me/tradeforms?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{user1_token}}
